WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Imagine a tape that promises better memory.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Now change the label, but not the recording.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Researchers separated what listeners believed from the audio content.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The tested tapes did not deliver their claimed performance gains. Reports could follow the label.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Before buying, ask which product was tested, against what, and what actually changed.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The source should outlast the promise. Read the evidence; try the free fieldwork.
